        }
      }
    ],
    "matters": [
      {
        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "Although not portraits of classic beauty, his depictions of Parisian prostitutes embrace the poignancy of human experience. Here, a prostitute unhooks her corset in the presence of a client, her face sympathetically averted from the viewer's gaze.",
